From 9e0c7e24e64644cb1faf55a7381a5ece747b0a3a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Xiangyu Yin <xyin@anl.gov>
Date: Mon, 12 Oct 2026 14:22:03 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] Fix three EXAFS defects: Debye sigma2 read the wrong path
 after lmfit copied the parameters, AUTOBK clamps depended on the units of mu,
 and estimate_noise ignored its window

sigma2_debye and sigma2_eins stayed bound to the interpreter lmfit had copied
from, so every path got the last path's sigma2 and the fitted Debye
temperature moved with the path order. AUTOBK now weighs its endpoint clamps
on chi in edge-step units. estimate_noise passed its window under a keyword
the transform ignores.

XAScraft-commit: b334e57f8057cc25bef21d91968101c28195337a
---
 larch/xafs/autobk.py         | 11 +++--
 larch/xafs/estimate_noise.py |  2 +-
 larch/xafs/feffdat.py        |  9 +++-
 tests/test_xafs_defects.py   | 91 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 4 files changed, 108 insertions(+), 5 deletions(-)
 create mode 100644 tests/test_xafs_defects.py

